OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,5,     GJools is joined by musician and
OL,6,     Gbandleader David Hermlin.
OL,7,G1300FMusic Matters: The President and
OL,8,     Fthe Polka
OL,9,     GJustin Webb explores the
OL,10,     Grelationship between classical
OL,11,     Gmusic and American political
OL,12,     Ghistory. Today, music in the
OL,13,     Gservice of Cold War influence.
OL,14,G1400FRecord Review
OL,15,     GAndrew McGregor picks the best
OL,16,     Gnew classical releases, joined by
OL,17,     Gguests Cathy Newman and William
OL,18,     GMival, who recommends his
OL,19,     Gfavorite recording of Sibelius's
OL,20,     GSymphony No. 5.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
