OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G1600FSound Of Cinema
OL,5,     GYour weekly trip to the movies
OL,6,     Gwith Edith Bowman- this week,
OL,7,     GDebbie Wiseman talks about her
OL,8,     Gscore to the film Wilde, and
OL,9,     GJools Holland chooses his Pick of
OL,10,     Gthe Flicks.
OL,11,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,12,     GJess is joined by conductor Harry
OL,13,     GChristophers to swap the music
OL,14,     Gthey love the most, with bouncing
OL,15,     Gtracks by Abel Selaocoe and
OL,16,     GBeyonce, and an aching finale by
OL,17,     GMahler.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
